// ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
// TS export class CodeCliBridge extends EventEmitter implements
// CodexRuntimeClient (source lines 542-3604) -> struct + fn family.
// DEFECT: class inheritance (EventEmitter) — emit() modelled as a host
// callback writing (eventName, JsonText) out; no event emitter in sa_std.
// DEFECT: Map/Set fields — every Map<string,V> / Set<string> below is stored
// as a JSON text buffer (keys+values serialized) + a count; lookups are
